XFollowing is a description of the various intrinsics listed in the monster
Xinformation section above.  Note that not all possible intrinsic flags for
Xeach monster were listed, as we consider some of them to be unimportant to
Xplay of the game.  If an intinsic is preceded with an asterisk (*) here, the
Xcorpse of any monster with that intrinsic can confer an intrisic to a player
Xif eaten.  See the DEAD MONSTERS section for more information about corpses
Xconferring intrinsics.
X
X Intrinsic    Description
X ---------    -----------
X*Acidic     - Monster corpse is acidic when eaten
X Amorph.    - Monster is amorphous and can flow under doors
X Domestic   - Monster can be tamed by throwing food at it
X*Cold Res   - Monster is cold resistant
X*Disin Res  - Monster is resistant to disintegration
X*Fire Res   - Monster is fire resistant
X Fly        - Monster can fly or float in the air
X Hides      - Monster can hide under objects
X Lay Eggs   - Monster can lay eggs
X Metalvore  - Monster is "metallivorous," and will eat all metal encountered
X No Corpse  - Monster will never leave a corpse when killed
X No Eyes    - Monster has no eyes to gaze into or blind
X No Hands   - Monster has no hands to pick things or manipulate objects
X No Limbs   - Monster has no limbs (arms or legs)
X No Poly.   - Player cannot polymorph into this type of monster
X Phase      - Monster can "phase" (i.e. walk through walls, doors, etc.)
X Poisonous  - Monster corpse is poisonous if eaten
X*Pois Res   - Monster is poison resistant
X Regen      - Monster regenerates hit points each round
X See Invis  - Monster can see invisible creatures
X*Shock Res  - Monster is resistant to electrical attacks
X*Sleep Res  - Monster is sleep resistant
X Stone Res  - Monster cannot be turned to stone
