XTHRONE EFFECTS:
X
XWhen you sit upon a throne, you have a one in six chance of having some effect
Xtake place.  The effects which can take place are as follows (equal chances):
X
X 1. You lose 3-6 points from a random attribute, and lose 1-10 hp.
X 2. One point is added to random attribute.
X 3. A [massive] charge of electricity shoots through your body!  (You lose 1-6
X    hp if shock resistant.  Otherwise you lose 1-30 hp.)
X 4. You feel much, much better!  (If your hp are within 5 of max, add 4 to max.
X    Hp are raised to max, heal blindness, sickness, and bad legs.)
X 5. You notice you have no gold.  (All gold lost)
X    You feel a strange sensation.  (If you have no gold)
X 6. You feel your luck is changing.  (If luck + random of [0-4] < 0, +1 luck)
X    Otherise, you can wish for an item.
X 7. You hear a voice echo:  "Thy audience has been summoned, Sire!"  (Rather
X    obvious:  lots of nasties get summoned.)
X 8. You hear a voice echo:  "By thy imperious order, Sire!"  (You get to
X    genocide one creature.)
X 9. You hear a voice echo:  "A curse upon thee for sitting upon this most holy
X    throne."  (If luck > 0, blinded for 250-349 turns; else random item cursed)
X10. An image forms in your mind.  (If luck < 0 or you have intrinsic see
X       invis. - magic maps level)
X    Your vision clarifies.  (Otherwise gain see invisible)
X11. You feel threatened.  (Aggravte monsters if luck < 0)
X    You feel a wrenching sensation.  (Otherwise teleport)
X12. You are granted a gift of insight.  (Identify item(s) in pack)
X13. Your mind turns into a pretzel.  (You are confused for 16-22 turns)
X
